  "_grouping_rule": "Cross-submission aggregation of amount_musd is undefined by policy without a budget_year or amount_basis filter: one absolute fiscal year may carry several submissions' views of itself (e.g. FY2026 appears as the FY26 request and as the FY27 current-year estimate). Filter by budget_year (the submission) or by amount_basis before summing.",
